law.text:
		Unless the terms of a trust provide otherwise, the rules applicable to a trustee apply to a trust director regarding the following matters:

Acceptance under § 64.2-754;


Giving of bond to secure performance under § 64.2-755;


Reasonable compensation under § 64.2-761;


Resignation under § 64.2-758;


Removal under § 64.2-759; and


Vacancy and appointment of successor under § 64.2-757.
